Scope note: third-party trademarks

The license above covers this repository's own source, including the
monocle drawn in Icon/monocl.svg.

It does NOT grant any right to the Claude flare, which is Anthropic's
trademark, reproduced unaltered and used here only to identify the
service MonoCl reads.  Anthropic reserves its own rights in that mark;
nothing in the BSD grant above conveys them, and a redistributor of
this source acquires no license to the mark by receiving it.

The mark is present in three places, not one, and a derivative work
whose use of it Anthropic has not agreed to must remove it from all of
them:

  - Icon/monocl.svg, as the file's single `<path>` element;
  - every PNG under MonoCl/Assets.xcassets/AppIcon.appiconset/, each
    rasterized from that path and committed rather than generated at
    build time;
  - the icon resources of any application bundle built from this
    source, which are compiled from those PNGs.

Deleting the path alone leaves the mark in the committed icon set and
in every binary built from it.
